{"_id": "llm_agent_and_tool--chat_history_ana--n--63522", "text": "{\n    \"conversation_id\": \"conv_789\",\n    \"user_id\": \"user123\",\n    \"message_timestamp\": \"2024-01-26T10:31:00Z\",\n    \"message_content\": \"Here's a Python function to calculate the Fibonacci sequence:\\n```python\\ndef fibonacci(n):\\n  if n <= 0:\\n    return []\\n  elif n == 1:\\n    return [0]\\n  else:\\n    list_fib = [0, 1]\\n    while len(list_fib) < n:\\n      next_fib = list_fib[-1] + list_fib[-2]\\n      list_fib.append(next_fib)\\n    return list_fib\\n```\",\n    \"message_role\": \"user\",\n    \"response_time\": 0.8,\n    \"chat_summary\": \"User provided Python code.\"\n}"}
