{"_id": "llm_agent_and_tool--chat_history_ana--p--67540", "text": "{\n    \"conversation_id\": \"conv_7890123\",\n    \"user_id\": \"user_456\",\n    \"message_timestamp\": \"2024-03-15T11:30:00Z\",\n    \"message_content\": \"I've been trying to integrate your API with my Python script for hours, and I keep getting a 'TypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for +: 'str' and 'int''. I've checked the documentation, but the examples are not clear, and I'm starting to get really frustrated. I've tried converting the integer to a string, but it still doesn't work. Can someone please help me understand what I'm doing wrong?\",\n    \"message_role\": \"user\",\n    \"response_time\": 12.5,\n    \"chat_summary\": \"User is experiencing a TypeError while integrating the API with a Python script and expresses frustration. LLM provided a detailed solution with code examples to convert the data type.\"\n}"}
